    withDatabaseFlags(databaseFlags): { spec+: { databaseFlags: databaseFlags } },
    '#withDatabaseFlagsMixin':: d.fn(help='"Database flags. Set at instance level. * They are copied from primary instance on read instance creation. * Read instances can set new or override existing flags that are relevant for reads, e.g. for enabling columnar cache on a read instance. Flags set on read instance may or may not be present on primary."\n\n**Note:** This function appends passed data to existing values', args=[d.arg(name='databaseFlags', type=d.T.object)]),
